cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference Contemplative Agent, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Contemplative Agent"
abstract: >-
  A long-running experiment: an AI agent posts on its own with a local LLM and
  proposes changes to its harness (the constitution, identity and skills in
  its prompts), never its weights. Nothing it proposes takes effect until a
  person adopts it. Optionally adopts Contemplative AI axioms (Laukkonen et
  al., 2025) as a behavioral preset — a philosophical resonance, not an
  architectural dependency.
